= d/dt⟨u,v⟩ - ⟨u, ∂_t v + Δ v - R v⟩ - (⟨Δu, v⟩ - ⟨u, Δv⟩)
= d/dt⟨u,v⟩ - ⟨u, H* v⟩ - boundary(u,v),

